# Half-slope stubs - way terminates on the slope's low / high edge,
# sprite covers only the half of the tile near that edge.  Baked by
# scene.py's bake_pakset() into road_040_hex_slope_half.png: 6x2 (or 6x4 if
# has_double_slopes) grid following SLOPE_HEX_HALF_ENTRIES order
# (row 0 low halves, row 1 high halves, then rows 2-3 for the
# double-height variants).  Narrow and wide share cells exactly
# like the full crossing atlas above.

